--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: YuriAsksSomePertinentQuestions
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118740072857651
    - rid: 1790118740072857652
    - rid: 1790118740072857719
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Haaahh... haaahh...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118740072857653
    - rid: 1790118740072857654
    - rid: 1790118740072857655
    - rid: 1790118740072857656
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (While still tiring, it seems that the distance doesn't impact the strain
      inflicted upon the caster.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118740072857658
    - rid: 1790118740072857659
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9a5ea5c94adebd840ac464dd04a1ceae, type: 2}
    dialog: Hey. You mind moving your teleportation experiment out of my library?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118740072857660
    - rid: 1790118740072857661
    - rid: 1790118740072857662
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9a5ea5c94adebd840ac464dd04a1ceae, type: 2}
    dialog: I don't want to have to clean up any guts from you phasing into any unaware
      students trying to find a book.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118740072857663
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh! O-of course! My apologies...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: I'll move my mark right away-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118740072857664
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118740072857665
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Actually, before I leave, I have a question for you Mr. gro-Shub.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118740072857666
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Do you know of anyone who's studied about the Dwemer?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9a5ea5c94adebd840ac464dd04a1ceae, type: 2}
    dialog: The Dwemer, hm?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118760230944768
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9a5ea5c94adebd840ac464dd04a1ceae, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, the most obvious person who would fit that description would be
      Calcelmo, who lives in Markarth.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9a5ea5c94adebd840ac464dd04a1ceae, type: 2}
    dialog: He's spent the better part of his life studying the Dwemer ruins beneath
      the city.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Markarth? Where is that?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118760230944823
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9a5ea5c94adebd840ac464dd04a1ceae, type: 2}
    dialog: ... really?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118760230944824
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Urag goes to grab something from his desk.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118760230944825
    - rid: 1790118760230944826
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9a5ea5c94adebd840ac464dd04a1ceae, type: 2}
    dialog: 'Here:'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118760230944828
    - rid: 1790118760230944829
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Urag gives the map he grabbed from his desk to Yuri.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118760230944833
    - rid: 1790118786062614611
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9a5ea5c94adebd840ac464dd04a1ceae, type: 2}
    dialog: Markarth is the capital of the Reach, in the southwest portion of Skyrim;
      past the Kreath.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118760230944834
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah. Thank you, Mr. gro-Shub.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118760230944830
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9a5ea5c94adebd840ac464dd04a1ceae, type: 2}
    dialog: 'I''ll have to warn you: if you plan on going down there anytime soon
      you need to watch yourself.'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118760230944831
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9a5ea5c94adebd840ac464dd04a1ceae, type: 2}
    dialog: The Forsworn have become quite... volatile as of late.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118760230944832
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: The Forsworn? Who are they?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118760230944835
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9a5ea5c94adebd840ac464dd04a1ceae, type: 2}
    dialog: A militant group of Reachmen who want to expunge all foreigners from
      their "rightful" land.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118760230944836
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (... I'm not sure if I should go to this place alone...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (But who would I go with-?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118760230944837
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: -!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118760230944838
    - rid: 1790118760230944840
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (Um... <b>player</b>? Can you hear me?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118760230944839
    - rid: 1790118786062614528
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118760230944841
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (D-d-do you kn-kn-know...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118786062614531
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118786062614533
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118786062614534
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118786062614536
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: Hm...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: I know Monika's busy working on solving some murder case in Whiterun...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118786062614538
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki's <i>probably</i> busy getting used to her new role in the Companions...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118786062614539
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: And I've yet to see Sayori since she left to go after {mc}.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118786062614540
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: So the girls are busy, yeah.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: You could <i>try</i> asking the other students here-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118786062614541
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: If your idea about them basically doing nothing until plot-relevant is
      true, they wouldn't be doing anything important.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c1c9ab1bd810549a65874b102351c3, type: 2}
    dialog: But even if you can't get anyone to help you, I'd still be with you in
      spirit. (As spirit?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118786062614542
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (I... I see...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118786062614543
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118786062614545
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118786062614547
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Thank you for the information, Mr. gro-Shub.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118786062614550
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9a5ea5c94adebd840ac464dd04a1ceae, type: 2}
    dialog: Of course.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118786062614603
    - rid: 1790118786062614604
    - rid: 1790118786062614605
    - rid: 1790118786062614606
    - rid: 1790118786062614607
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (If I am going to Markarth, I should probably prepare supplies for the
      trip-)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118786062614608
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (It <i>is</i> on nearly the opposite end of Skyrim from Winterhold.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118786062614610
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Yuri leaves the college grounds to go to the only general store in Winterhold
      to get equipped for her journey.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 1790118786062614612
    - rid: 1790118786062614613
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
